  parquetImportHint: ['Parquet 支持常见压缩的平面表。超出安全整数范围的值保留为文本；日期精度为毫秒，支持最多 8 层嵌套列表，结构和二进制字段暂不支持。导入后保存为可备份的 JSON 数据源。', 'Parquet supports flat tables with common compression codecs. Integers outside the safe range stay as text; dates have millisecond precision. Lists support up to 8 nested levels; structs and binary columns are currently unsupported. Imported tables become portable JSON sources.'],
