  datetimeHint: ["默认读取 ISO 日期；自定义格式例如 %d/%m/%Y %H:%M。无时区原文按源时区解释，已有偏移按原文解释；输出日期为 UTC ISO，精度为毫秒。日期部件可按目标时区提取，星期一编号为 0。", "ISO dates are read by default; an example custom format is %d/%m/%Y %H:%M. Naive text uses the source zone; explicit offsets take precedence. Parsed dates are UTC ISO with millisecond precision. Components use the target zone; Monday is weekday 0."],
  resampleHint: ["日 / 周 / 月 / 季 / 年使用目标时区的日历边界，周以星期一为边界，右闭合周频包含整个边界日；月季年使用首日边界。每组独立补齐；空时段的 sum/count/size 为 0，prod 为 1，其余按聚合定义处理。分钟 / 小时可指定时长和起点。", "Day/week/month/quarter/year use calendar boundaries in the target zone. Weeks use Monday boundaries; right-closed weeks include the entire boundary day. Months, quarters and years use first-day boundaries. Gaps are filled per group; empty sum/count/size are 0 and prod is 1; other methods follow their aggregation rules. Minute/hour intervals support a duration and origin."],
